    <solution><p>SOLUTION</p>
<p><me>\begin{array}{rcl} \displaystyle \int_0^{4} (5 e^x+4 \sin x)\, dx \amp =\amp   
\displaystyle  5 e^x-4 \cos x  \Big]_0^{4}
\\ \amp =\amp  (5 e^{4} - 4 \cos 4) - (5 e^0 - 4 \cos0 ) 
\\ \amp =\amp  5 e^{4} - 4 \cos 4 - 1 
\end{array}</me></p>
</solution>
